<title>USA: TABLE - Healthcare Recoveries Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Healthcare Recoveries Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months ended	6 Months ended</p>
<p>					June 30,		June 30,</p>
<p>				  1997	1996	1997	1996</p>
<p>  Total revenues	   9,324     8,650    18,240    15,326</p>
<p>Non-recurring compensation charge</p>
<p>				 2,848	   -     2,848	   -</p>
<p>Net income (loss)	($1,264)   $1,703	$112    $2,600</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>				10,243     9,800    10,043     9,800</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per common</p>
<p> share			($0.12)    $0.17     $0.01     $0.27</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>As Adjusted:</p>
<p>Subrogation revenues    $9,324    $7,680   $18,240   $14,356</p>
<p>Net income		   1,584     1,140     2,960     2,037</p>
<p>Earnings per common share</p>
<p>				 $0.15     $0.12     $0.29     $0.21</p>
<p>	     (Dollars in thousands, except per share results)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Healthcare Recoveries Inc said its net income for the second quarter of 1997 included a nonrecurring noncash $2.8 million compensation charge related to Medaphis Corp's divestiture of Healthcare Recoveries Inc and $563,000 of net income from the implant settlement in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Net income for the first six months of 1997 includes $970,000 of nonrecurring revenue received from the implant settlement and the $2.8 million compensation charge.</p>
